SR-IOV tests

All the tests run with two hosts. One runs as client, and the other as server
netperf runs on the client and netserver runs on server

Macros MUST be defined before running
CLIENTS=
SERVERS=
JOBID=
NIC_DRIVER=any
image_name=rhel6.7.qcow2
SRIOV_TOPO=test_name if only the specific test is to run

Macros can be changed if needed.
pkg_netperf="ftp://ftp.netperf.org/netperf/netperf-2.6.0.tar.bz2"
img_vm="http://netqe-infra01.knqe.eng.rdu2.dc.redhat.com/vm/$image_name"

